<p>
            We have not tested these mats. They were chosen from published specifications, maker and
            Amazon listings, and independent reviews, and every claim on this page is limited to
            what those sources support. Where we describe grip, smell or break-in, we are reporting
            what reviewers and the makers say, not our own experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            We started from the materials buyers actually choose between — PVC, TPE, natural rubber,
            a polyurethane top over rubber, and NBR foam — and looked for a well-documented mat in
            each that is currently listed on Amazon US. On 19 October 2026 we checked each against
            the maker's page or the Amazon listing and at least one independent source: Garage Gym
